{
  "id": "a1-u04-l04",
  "unit": "a1-u04",
  "order": 4,
  "title": "Me too",
  "goal": "Hold a short how-are-you conversation, and say me too and me neither with dA.",
  "points": ["gp-de-also", "gp-answers", "gp-question-mi", "gp-degil", "gp-question-words"],
  "intro": {
    "text": "*dA* means **too** or **also**. It is a separate word, right after the word it adds, in two-way harmony: *Ben de yorgunum* (I'm tired too), *Murat da hasta*. In a negative sentence it means **either**: *Ben de yorgun değilim*.",
    "see": "gp-de-also"
  },
  "vocab": [
    {
      "tr": "de",
      "en": "too, also; either (with a negative)",
      "pos": "particle",
      "card": "fc-0009"
    },
    {
      "tr": "öyle",
      "en": "so, like that",
      "pos": "adv",
      "card": "fc-0052"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Öyle mi?",
      "en": "Really? Is that so?",
      "pos": "phrase"
    },
    {
      "tr": "değil mi",
      "en": "isn't it, aren't you, right (a question tag)",
      "pos": "phrase"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Ne haber?",
      "en": "What's up? How's it going?",
      "pos": "phrase"
    },
    {
      "tr": "İdare eder.",
      "en": "So-so. Not bad.",
      "pos": "phrase"
    },
    {
      "tr": "haklı",
      "en": "right, in the right",
      "pos": "adj",
      "card": "fc-0298"
    }
  ],
  "exercises": [
    {
      "id": "a1-u04-l04-e01",
      "type": "mcq",
      "points": ["gp-de-also"],
      "question": "How do you say **Murat is tired too**?",
      "options": ["Murat da yorgun.", "Murat de yorgun.", "Murat ta yorgun.", "Murat'da yorgun."],
      "optionsLang": "tr",
      "answer": 0,
      "why": {
        "1": "The last vowel of *Murat* is a, a back vowel, so *dA* is *da*.",
        "2": "*dA* never turns into *ta*, even after t.",
        "3": "*dA* is a separate word, not a suffix: no apostrophe, and a space before it."
      },
      "explain": "Two-way harmony after a: *da*. The d stays d whatever comes before it."
    },
    {
      "id": "a1-u04-l04-e02",
      "type": "cloze",
      "points": ["gp-de-also"],
      "text": "Ben yorgunum, Ayşe ___ yorgun.",
      "en": "I'm tired, Ayşe is tired too.",
      "blanks": [
        {
          "accept": ["de"],
          "reject": [
            {
              "answer": "da",
              "why": "The last vowel of *Ayşe* is e, so *dA* is *de*."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "explain": "*Ayşe* ends in e, a front vowel: *Ayşe de*."
    },
    {
